<newsitem itemid="535075" id="root" date="1997-04-24" xml:lang="en">
<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Newport lifts half-yr income.</title>
<headline>Newport lifts half-yr income.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Distribution/unit (cts)     30.21    vs    28.44</p>
<p>    Net income			14.59    vs    13.74</p>
<p>    Dividend/interest income    15.18    vs    14.45</p>
<p>    Expenses			   0.59    vs    0.72</p>
<p>Distribution payable May 30</p>
<p>on register April 18</p>
<p>Full name: Newport Property Fund</p>
<p>NOTE - The company sai dthe letting market was buoyant and management expected earnings for the full year to be in line with forecasts.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
